Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:32:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs: stop putting API_TOKEN in wrangler.toml

Operators set the token with wrangler secret put. .dev.vars is ignored. The KV binding matches the current Wrangler 4 config.
---
 .gitignore |  2 ++
 README.md  | 69 +++++++++++++++++++-----------------------------------
 2 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 45 deletions(-)

